## Issue Body
The user reported a compilation failure in `el2_dec_tlu_ctl.sv` where identifiers are referenced before being declared. The specific error message states:

> "Identifier 'CYCLEL' has not been declared yet. If this error is not expected, please check if you have set `default_nettype to none."

The error occurs at line 998 of the file located in the VeeR EL2 core's design/dec directory.

